OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FA grey day for many in the      
OL,6,Fsouth with outbreaks of rain. Drier    
OL,7,Ffurther north with bright or even      
OL,8,Fsunny spells at times. Gusty on high   
OL,9,Fground but easing through the day.     
OL,10,FSlightly cooler than Wednesday.        
OL,12,CTonight:FLight rain continues in the   
OL,13,Fsouth with clearer skies developing    
OL,14,Ffor the north of the region.           
OL,15,FTemperatures here will fall away to    
OL,16,Fbelow freezing causing a widespread    
OL,17,Ffrost in places.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
