OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CFriday:FRain the south moves off as    
OL,6,Fbright and sunny spells cover the      
OL,7,Fregion. Light winds, however feeling   
OL,8,Frather cool for many.                  
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA cold 
OL,11,Fstart to Saturday with the risk of ice 
OL,12,Ffirst thing, but bright and sunny to   
OL,13,Fstart. Turning cloudier on Sunday with 
OL,14,Frain moving into the west through      
OL,15,FMonday.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
